  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA">弘</persName>四弟：<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAB">虞</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAC">柳</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAD">孺</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0010" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAE">曇首</persName>。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAB">虞</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAB">休仲</persName>，位廷尉卿。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0023" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAB">虞</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0025" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAABA">深</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0027" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAABA">景度</persName>，有美名，位新安太守。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0040" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAC">柳</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0042" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAD">孺</persName>事列於前，<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wanghong-brothers:p001:m0048" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAE">曇首</persName>別卷。</p>
</text>
